stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> uploaded: file accepted
  uploaded --> queued: job created
  queued --> extracting: worker claims the job
  queued --> failed: original file is missing
  extracting --> chunking: text found
  extracting --> failed: no text or unreadable file
  chunking --> embedding: chunks saved
  embedding --> indexed: vectors stored
  embedding --> classifying: embedding unavailable, text still processed
  indexed --> classifying
  classifying --> completed: every stage done
  classifying --> failed: embedding had been unavailable
  failed --> extracting: automatic retry, up to 3 attempts
  failed --> queued: Reprocess button
  completed --> queued: Reprocess button
  completed --> [*]
